# Paths the shared leak gate (devtools:lint-leaks) exempts from its
# publishable patterns, one ERE per line. Private literals still apply.
#
# Vendored and deployed trees answer to their upstream: the devtools
# payload and its mise drop-ins, the APM-deployed agent files, the Vale
# styles, and the Go and package-manager module trees. The shared gate's
# own test suite sits under .devtools/ and plants the base shapes.
^\.claude/
^\.agents/
^\.devtools/
^\.config/mise/conf\.d/
^\.vale/
^vendor/
^node_modules/
^apm_modules/
# The repository rules spell out the shapes they look for.
^\.leak-patterns$
